    "Tell me about your event. For example:\n• \"Team meeting at 10 AM\"\n• \"Lunch from 12 to 1 daily\"\n• \"Gym at 6 PM on weekdays\"" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "告訴我你的日程。例如：\n• \"10點開會\"\n• \"每天中午12點到1點午餐\"\n• \"平日下午6點健身\""
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I've parsed your event. Review the details below and make any adjustments:" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "我已理解你的日程。請查看以下詳情並進行調整："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No problem! Tell me about a different event." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "沒問題！告訴我其他日程。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I couldn't fully understand that. Could you try again with more details? For example: \"Meeting with team at 2 PM for 1 hour\"" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "我沒有完全理解。請再試一次，提供更多細節。例如：\"下午2點和團隊開會，1小時\""
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version" : "1.0"
